"二维码无法生成，请重试或使用手动连接。" = "Could not generate a QR code. Try again or use manual setup.";
"二维码是本次临时授权凭据，请勿分享或截图转发。关闭此窗口或切换方式会停止发现和自动投屏；已完成的手机授权不会因此撤销。" = "This QR code is a temporary authorization credential. Do not share it or send screenshots. Closing this window or changing methods stops discovery and automatic mirroring, but does not revoke authorization already granted by your phone.";
"仅在可信网络使用。若系统询问，请允许镜连访问本地网络；访客 Wi-Fi、设备隔离或 VPN 可能阻止发现。用完可在手机关闭无线调试。发现手机不代表获得授权。" = "Use only on trusted networks. Allow MirrorLink to access the local network if macOS asks. Guest Wi-Fi, device isolation, or a VPN may prevent discovery. You can turn off wireless debugging when finished. Discovering a phone does not authorize access.";
"仅用于本次配对" = "For this pairing only";
