"无线投屏使用 80 ms 视频缓冲平滑短时抖动，会增加少量延迟。网络持续不足或手机过热时仍可能卡顿，可优先改用 USB 连接。目标码率与帧率上限不代表实测值。" = "Wireless mirroring uses an 80 ms video buffer to smooth brief fluctuations, adding a little latency. Limited bandwidth or an overheating phone may still cause stuttering; try USB. Target bitrate and frame-rate limits are not measured values.";
"无线设备尚未就绪。请检查无线调试授权与当前连接端口，必要时重新配对。" = "The wireless device is not ready. Check its debugging authorization and current connection port. Pair again if needed.";
"无线调试尚未授权或授权已失效。请先到“扫码配对”扫描二维码；不支持扫码时可使用手动配对。" = "Wireless debugging is not authorized or authorization has expired. Scan a code in QR Pairing first, or use manual pairing if QR pairing is unavailable.";
